PASS an ECDSA P-256 client certificate completes the handshake: error 0
PASS a client certificate from another CA is refused: error 1002 (1002 = the server refused the certificate)
PASS an expired client certificate is refused: error 1002 (1002)
PASS an RSA client certificate (not Ed25519 or P-256) is refused: error 1003 (a handshake failure on either side)
